---
/* The Recall wordmark, as on the landing page: the accent dot, then the name.
   Callers keep the site title as the link's accessible name, so this is hidden. */
---
<span class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2.5 text-[18px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]" aria-hidden="true">
  <i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-brand shadow-[0_0_12px_var(--nb-brand)]"></i>Recall
</span>
